title: Conductor revival arc — understand-and-correlate phase complete; thesis locked
summary: 'Two-round team analysis (a-aloud voice-comms correlation + PewDiePie''s Odysseus interface study) to scope the Conductor revival arc. Landed a sharp, founder-validated thesis: Conductor becomes a hybrid macOS desktop app whose heart is a CUSTOM conversation UI over Claude Code sessions driven by the structured headless stream (claude -p stream-json), replacing today''s Accessibility terminal-scraping, while preserving native control actions and serving as the container for the settled presence/page/reply on-call contract. Feasibility of the headless-stream foundation verified GREEN against Claude Code docs.'
symbols_touched:
  - '#conductor'
  - '#symphony'
decisions:
  - id: TD-conductor-arc-001
    decision: 'Conductor revival = hybrid desktop app: native control plane (AX-drive-CC, menu-bar presence, hotkeys, mic, system notifications) + custom conversation UI; reuse web Platform where sensible, do NOT native-rebuild every section.'
    rationale: Swift + North converged on hybrid; honors the 1-day-old web-primary decision (TD-2026-06-14-853) and keeps Conductor's AX moat a pure web-shell would discard.
  - id: TD-conductor-arc-002
    decision: Converse with Claude Code via the structured headless stream (claude -p --output-format stream-json --input-format stream-json), rendering a custom chat UI + custom handling — NOT terminal-scraping via Accessibility.
    rationale: 'Founder confirmed this is exactly the target. Feasibility verified GREEN: bidirectional stream-json, multi-session via --session-id/--resume, headless permission control + tool observation, native Swift embedding by spawning CLI + piping JSON. Recommended mechanism = CLI+stream-json over SDK sidecar for a Swift app.'
  - id: TD-conductor-arc-003
    decision: Steal Odysseus's INTERACTION patterns (session spine, background-run + page-back notification, run replay-buffer, disk-backed status, supervisor loop), NOT its architecture/code. Leave all content verticals (email/calendar/cookbook/docs).
    rationale: Odysseus is Python/Flask + vanilla-JS; not portable to TS/Swift. Its 'desktop app' is a bash launcher and it does NOT host Claude Code (CC calls into it). Value is the comms UX + run substrate patterns, right-sized to the terminal-sprawl friction.
  - id: TD-conductor-arc-004
    decision: Voice stays one swappable client (a-aloud) of a shared presence/page/reply contract; the invention is presence-gated push + agent-initiated page/reply, not voice. Human consults are high-value calibration signal and must write to ~/.paradigm/ substrate.
    rationale: Settled with founder earlier in arc; Loid's learning-loop constraint + the a-aloud broker correlation.
learnings:
  - Odysseus does NOT host/manage Claude Code instances — the arrow is inverted (CC reaches into Odysseus via scope-gated /api/codex/* + a skill bundle). Founder never believed otherwise; he wanted Odysseus's agent-communication INTERFACE, not its (nonexistent) hosting.
  - Founder's actual friction = the conversation experience with CC sessions inside Conductor today (mediated by AX terminal-scraping) is bad. Cure = a real structured-stream conversation UI.
  - 'Claude Code headless feasibility GREEN: claude -p with stream-json in+out gives bidirectional structured conversation; --session-id/--resume for N concurrent independent processes; --allowedTools/--permission-mode + --permission-prompt-tool for programmatic approval; tool_use events emitted before execution. Gotchas at scale: token quota, stdout buffering/ordering per-process, zombie cleanup on app crash, background-bash terminated ~5s after session ends.'
  - a-aloud's broker and Symphony relay are the same WS-hub shape pointed at different endpoints (human vs peer-agents); unify only thin contracts (waiting/resume primitive, presence vocabulary, four-verb MCP surface, intent taxonomy), NOT transport/auth/identity/content-policy.
  - The conductor-symphony-fixes.md 5 fixes are already SHIPPED (v5.27.0); Conductor is more voice-ready than assumed (WhisperKit/CoreML STT, AVCaptureSession, mic TCC solved) but lacks UserNotifications + TTS + a WKWebView host.
